 over medium heat. Simmer, stirring ocassionally. Transfer to a container and refrigerate overnight before using.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3251</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
